      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_FREYDIN_2",
      "text_source": "Liandris, we have been made aware of some unusual beings recently appearing across Terragaya.",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-solemn",
      "intent": "exposition-warning",
      "risk_level": "medium",
      "base_translation": "Liandris, tomamos conhecimento de seres inusitados surgindo em Terragaya.",
      "byte_budget": 93,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": "lore-mention Terragaya; humans as external element (early exposition) — verify consistency across episode"
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_LIANDRIS_3",
      "text_source": "Do you mean the Humans?",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-military",
      "intent": "clarification-question",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "base_translation": "Refere-se aos Humanos?",
      "byte_budget": 23,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_FREYDIN_4",
      "text_source": "Huma-? Oh... “Those” humans",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-solemn",
      "intent": "dismissal-correction",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "base_translation": "Huma-? Ah... \"Esses\" humanos.",
      "byte_budget": 31,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_FREYDIN_5",
      "text_source": "I am aware of the phenomenon that has brought them to Terragaya but these beings are not our concern at this moment.",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-solemn",
      "intent": "prioritization-dismissal",
      "risk_level": "medium",
      "base_translation": "Conheço o fenômeno que os trouxe, mas não nos dizem respeito agora.",
      "byte_budget": 116,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": "spoiler-control: 'soulless beings' not yet introduced to player — translation avoids resolving referent (left opaque)"
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_LIANDRIS_6",
      "text_source": "They were “cut off” inside that dome, which is why we appeared.",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-military",
      "intent": "exposition-explanation",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "base_translation": "Foram \"isolados\" naquele domo; por isso aparecemos.",
      "byte_budget": 67,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_FREYDIN_7",
      "text_source": "Have I not made it clear that I have no interest in the Humans? I speak of the other soulless beings.",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-solemn",
      "intent": "rebuke-clarification",
      "risk_level": "high",
      "base_translation": "Não deixei claro? Não me interessam os Humanos. Falo dos outros seres.",
      "byte_budget": 101,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": "identity of 'soulless beings' concealed from player (spoiler); translation must preserve ambiguity — no resolution of referent or their nature"
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_LIANDRIS_8",
      "text_source": "...I understand. Should we act?",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-military",
      "intent": "obedience-question",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "base_translation": "...Entendo. Devemos agir?",
      "byte_budget": 31,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": "STR_DIALOGS_INTERMISSION_1_D2_FREYDIN_9",
      "text_source": "No... for now, be cautious, but watch them closely.",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "tone_register": "formal-solemn",
      "intent": "instruction-caution",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "base_translation": "Não... por enquanto, cautela, mas vigie-os bem.",
      "byte_budget": 51,
      "glossary_flags": [],
      "spoiler_flags": [],
      "risk_notes": ""
    },
    {
